@startuml
' umLoud template — state machine for ONE class
title <ClassName> — lifecycle
hide empty description
[*] --> Composite
state Composite {
  [*] --> StateA
  state StateB : entry / onEnter
  state StateB : do / ongoingWork
  state StateB : exit / onExit
  StateA --> StateB : event [guard] / activity
  StateB --> StateA : otherEvent
}
Composite --> Done : cancel / cleanup
StateB --> Done : finished
Done --> [*]
@enduml
